{"page":310,"verses":[{"verse_key":"19:65","surah":19,"ayah":65,"ar_uthmani":"رَّبُّ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ وَمَا بَيْنَهُمَا فَٱعْبُدْهُ وَٱصْطَبِرْ لِعِبَـٰدَتِهِۦ ۚ هَلْ تَعْلَمُ لَهُۥ سَمِيًّا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He is Lord of the heavens and earth and everything in between so worship Him: be steadfast in worshipping Him. Do you know of anyone equal to Him?’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"رَّبُّ","en_gloss":"Lord","transliteration":"rabbu","verse_key":"19:65"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"(of) the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"19:65"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","verse_key":"19:65"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and whatever","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"19:65"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بَيْنَهُمَا","en_gloss":"(is) between both of them","transliteration":"baynahumā","verse_key":"19:65"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَٱعْبُدْهُ","en_gloss":"so worship Him","transliteration":"fa-uʿ'bud'hu","verse_key":"19:65"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱصْطَبِرْ","en_gloss":"and be constant","transliteration":"wa-iṣ'ṭabir","verse_key":"19:65"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لِعِبَـٰدَتِهِۦ ۚ","en_gloss":"in His worship","transliteration":"liʿibādatihi","verse_key":"19:65"},{"pos":9,"ar":"هَلْ","en_gloss":"Do","transliteration":"hal","verse_key":"19:65"},{"pos":10,"ar":"تَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"you know","transliteration":"taʿlamu","verse_key":"19:65"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"for Him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"19:65"},{"pos":12,"ar":"سَمِيًّۭا","en_gloss":"any similarity","transliteration":"samiyyan","verse_key":"19:65"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٦٥","en_gloss":"(65)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"19:65"}]},{"verse_key":"19:66","surah":19,"ayah":66,"ar_uthmani":"وَيَقُولُ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ أَءِذَا مَا مِتُّ لَسَوْفَ أُخْرَجُ حَيًّا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Man says, ‘What? Once I am dead, will I be brought back to life?’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَيَقُولُ","en_gloss":"And says","transliteration":"wayaqū